# Run 2026-11-01, worldgen block: one fresh normal world (group B, seed 8675309) for the priority SQ-HR-05, the group B /
# C rows of the 2026-11-01 bug batch, and the r1031 W2 rows deferred on 10-31 (SQ-SB-04 to -08, SQ-SB-01e).
# prep: prep_srv.sh OUT r11w2 B difficulty=normal spawn-monsters=true spawn-animals=true; srv toml
# [worldgen.meta_structures] log = true. Each /locate may take up to 300 s; waitlog uses 330.
# W3a / W3b: tools/scratch_query/batches/r1031/w3_terrain.qb on their own worlds (plan scratch_run_2026-10-31.md 4).
pace 2

## SQ-W11-BOOT | boot clean, bot joins
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject (Mixin apply failed|InvalidInjectionException|Critical injection failure).*(creativeengineering|creative_delight|creative_brewing)
> gamerule sendCommandFeedback true
> pbot spawn qa 0 120 0 minecraft:overworld creative
> pbot status
expect ceperfbot ok

## SQ-TER-01b | ancient crypt sunk without warning; places on its own projection
bootexpect \[terrain-adaptation\] world load
bootreject ancient_crypt.*ignored
> locate structure philipsruins:ancient_crypt
waitlog nearest philipsruins:ancient_crypt is at|type "?philipsruins:ancient_crypt|philipsruins:ancient_crypt.*timed out 330
capture AC is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> tp qa {AC1} 140 {AC3}
sleep 25
look load line: 7 sunk starts, no crypt warning; the crypt position goes to the client tour (sunk, not floating)

## SQ-HR-05 | wild raspberry patches in forest
bootexpect \[wild-crops\].*raspberry
> locate biome minecraft:forest
waitlog nearest minecraft:forest is at 300
capture FO is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> tp qa {FO1} 150 {FO3}
sleep 40
> forceload add {FO1-64} {FO3-64} {FO1+64} {FO3+64}
sleep 30
> zq count {FO1-64} 50 {FO3-64} {FO1+64} 120 {FO3+64} hearthandharvest:raspberry_bush
> forceload remove all
look the [wild-crops] line lists rule raspberry (26 biomes); bushes counted in the forest square (> 0), ripe (age 3) ones among them; record the count

## SQ-EN-01 | librarians: no Nock Enough Arrows enchantments in trades
> forceload add -16 -16 16 16
> setblock 2 100 2 minecraft:lectern
> summon minecraft:villager 2 101 3 {VillagerData:{profession:"minecraft:librarian",level:1,type:"minecraft:plains"},NoAI:1b,Tags:["en1"]}
> data get entity @e[tag=en1,limit=1] Offers
> data merge entity @e[tag=en1,limit=1] {VillagerData:{level:5},Offers:{}}
sleep 2
> data get entity @e[tag=en1,limit=1] Offers
> dumptrades
sleep 5
reject nock_enough_arrows:(stockpile|recovery|cycle)
shell ! grep -rqE "nock_enough_arrows:(stockpile|recovery|cycle)" kubejs/exported/villager_trades.json
look librarians offer enchanted books; Offers reset at a level change may need a trade-up; record what the level-5 librarian offered

## SQ-EN-02 | Lightman's Currency cashiers: no NEA enchantments
> summon lightmanscurrency:cashier 6 101 3 {Tags:["en2"]}
sleep 2
> execute as @e[tag=en2] run data get entity @s
reject nock_enough_arrows:(stockpile|recovery|cycle)
look cashiers still offer enchanted books; the cashier trader type may not use villager offers: record what data shows

## SQ-MRD-03 | cheese toast, sliced potato tags
> zq rdetail cheese_toast
> zq itemtag forge:sliced_potato
> zq itemtag forge:sliced_potatoes
> zq rdetail moredelight:mashed_potatoes
expect itemtag forge:sliced_potatoes .*rusticdelight
look cheese toast shapeless (toast + flaxen cheese wedge); both slice tags hold Rustic's slices; More Delight potato recipes show a slice item

## SQ-META31-04b | meteorite desert pyramid never placed short
> locate structure creativeengineering:meta/meteorite_desert_pyramid
waitlog nearest creativeengineering:meta/meteorite_desert_pyramid is at|type "?creativeengineering:meta/meteorite_desert_pyramid|creativeengineering:meta/meteorite_desert_pyramid.*timed out 330
> execute positioned 6000 70 -6000 run locate structure creativeengineering:meta/meteorite_desert_pyramid
sleep 240
> execute positioned -6000 70 6000 run locate structure creativeengineering:meta/meteorite_desert_pyramid
sleep 240
bootreject meteorite_desert_pyramid.*0/1.*desert_pyramid
look every placed line 1/1 minecraft:desert_pyramid plus a meteorite; short ones "not placed, core part" or "no satellite fitted"

