## SQ-WG30-C02b | census false negatives carry a diagnosis (long: Chunky r 400 + census r 96)
> tp qa 2144 200 -2592
> chunky center 2144 -2592
> chunky radius 400
> chunky shape square
> chunky start
waitlog (?i)\[Chunky\].*(task finished|finished generating|complete) 3000
> celocate census 96 2144 -2592
waitlog (?i)census.*(done|finished|written) 2400
shell python3 -c "import json,sys; d=json.load(open('kubejs/exported/worldgen/locate_census.json')); s=json.dumps(d); sys.exit(0 if 'falseNegativeAt' in s else 1)"
look every biome false negative has a diagnosis string (regenerated point, biome, nearest-distance entries, start-piece centre); copy the census json into RES
